    "tooltip" : " D8 Weaponry | General Information",

    "category" : [
        {   
            "tooltipText" : " Weapon(s) Usage",
            "icon" : "/D8Weaponry/object/crafting/gunsmithTable/icon2.png",
            "pages" : [
                {
                    "text" : {
                        "type" : "text",
                        "position" : [0, -5],
                        "pageAnchor" : "topLeft",
                        "hAnchor" : "left",
                        "vAnchor" : "top",
                        "string" : [
                            "Weapon(s) in this mod generaly require a secondary item called a ^green;munition^reset;",
                            "both are usualy crafted at the ^orange;Gunsmith Table^reset;^blue;(?)^reset; and it variants.",
                            "",
                            "They use munition^blue;(?)^reset;, while less energy expensive require the user to reload",
                            "such process can vary both in time and cost.",
                            "",
                            "Those^blue;(?)^reset; that utilise magazine usualy require the user to remove the previous one",
                            "^red;Discarding the remaining munition in the process^reset;, these take less time than most.",
                            "",
                            "On the other hand the one(s)^blue;(?)^reset; that directly utilise the munition \"ex: shotgun\",",
                            "will take more time to completely reload but can be reloaded as long...",
                            "as you have at least one munition for it.",
                            "",
                            "Each level of the ^orange;Gunsmith Table^reset; give access to cheaper and faster recipe(s)",
                            "for munition."
                        ]
                    },
                    "tooltip" : {
                        "type" : "image",
                        "list" : [
