                        "hAnchor" : "left",
                        "vAnchor" : "top",
                        "string" : [
                            "The ^orange;Refinement Workbench^blue;(?)^reset; is a new station that is used to upgrade weapon(s).",
                            "Each level require some ^green;upgrade module(s)^reset; and level specific resource(s).",
                            "",
                            "If one wish to downgrade their weapon(s) there are able to do so... doing so will",
                            "give back some of the resource(s) used to upgrade to the current level"
                        ]
                    },
